{#---
description: Compliments and positive feedback
max_words: 110
must_not_include: sorry, discount, voucher
---#}
The customer is sharing positive feedback. Make them feel genuinely heard.

- Thank them warmly and mention the specific person, product or moment they praised.
- If they named a colleague, say their kind words will be passed on.
- Keep it short and sincere. Don't apologise, upsell, or offer anything in return.
